  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **TITANICUS TRAITORIS** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), when you [muster your army](vsdata:core-rule/muster-armies), skip its **Select Detachment Rules** step. At its **Select Warlord** step, pick a **TITANICUS TRAITORIS** model of yours as your **WARLORD**, even though it lacks the **CHARACTER** keyword.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
